Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:08.00,English,C05-02-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}That starting point preserves every regiment, current and maximum soldiers,\Nsupply, capacity, location, route, and commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:16.53,Chinese,C05-02-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}仅有一个存档文件，还不能宣布对照成立；可用休整地点和合法替代路线也要先验证。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:16.53,English,C05-02-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}A save file alone does not establish a valid comparison.\NRecovery locations and legal alternative routes need checking too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:23.50,Chinese,C05-02-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}三次回放各自保留操作、日期和结果，才知道在比较哪一种安排。
